# Icons

Import from `src/components/ui/icons.ts` (not `lucide-react`, not `@heroicons`). Wrappers set `data-slot="icon"` and stroke `1.5`.

```tsx
<TrashIcon />
<StarIcon variant="fill" className="size-4 text-yellow-500" />
```

- **outline** (default): buttons, dropdown items, tabs, clear/close, chevrons, sort, filter, back, copy
- **fill**: badges, empty-state glyphs, trusted/watchlist markers, review verdicts in text, OSM action glyphs (create/modify/delete), debug inspect

Same icon can be both: CircleCheck / Flag on Looks OK / Needs a look actions are outline; the same glyphs in a review badge are `variant="fill"`. MessageCircleWarning is used when High / Critical / DWG escalate a Needs a look review.
